HST Office: the Extension tab hides its trailing block while no extension adds buttons.

The Extension tab ("Phần mở rộng") of Writer, Sheets and Slides ended in a block with a tab menu button, an
empty icon box and a separator before it. Extensions put their toolbars in the tab's add-on box; when that
box holds nothing (no extension adds buttons), the block and the separator are hidden, and the page's
priority layout no longer shows them again. The menu's commands stay in the menu bar and the feature
search (Alt+Q). With an extension that adds buttons, the tab is as before.

- vcl/source/control/PriorityHBox.cxx.

